# =========================
# ACL Configuration
# =========================

# Admin user - full access
user admin_user
topic readwrite #

# Healthcheck user
user healthcheck
topic read health/ping

# Kafka bridge
user kafka_bridge
topic read iot/sensors/#
topic read iot/+/#

# Processor client
user processor-client
topic read iot/sensors/#
topic write iot/commands/#

# Dynamic pattern users
pattern write iot/sensors/%u/#
pattern read iot/commands/%u/#